          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aambire atu a Iziraeli hivi, ‘Mutu yeyesi achilavya sadaka ya amani, ni arehe seemu ya sadaka iyo kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andamrehera sadaka iyo na mikonoye dza zawadi. Andareha marunyage phamwenga na laga ambayo andaiunula dzulu mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu dza sadaka ya kuunulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlavyadzi-sadaka andaocha marunya gosi dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka, ela laga indakala ya Aruni na anae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiga cha kulume cha nyama wa sadaka zenu za amani mundamupha mlavyadzi-sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiga hicho chindakala cha mutu wa chivyazi cha Aruni ndiyemwaga-mwaga milatso na kulavya marunya ga sadaka ya amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kukala yo laga ichiyounulwa dzulu na cho chiga chirehwacho mbere yangu nkachihala kula kpwa sadaka za amani za Aiziraeli na nkachipha mlavyadzi-sadaka Aruni na chivyaziche, seemu hizo nkaapha hinyo alavyadzi-sadaka zikale mtalo wao hata kare na kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hizo ndizo seemu zotengbwa kpwa ajili ya Aruni na anae kahi ya sadaka za kuochwa areherwazo Mwenyezi Mlungu, hangu siku ariphoikpwa kukala alavyadzi-sadaka a Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphotakaswa kpwa kumwagirwa mafuha, Mwenyezi Mlungu waalagiza Aiziraeli aaphe seemu iyo ya sadaka; iyo indakala dza mtalo wao siku zosi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
